    "detailed_description": "<h1>Early Access Global Launch</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/20cab57fe6911632b929ebc72fe3dd15.avif?t=1750328296\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/d87709a6b5313e60e5df5854b790c82e.avif?t=1750328296\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a cataclysmic event, Hunters were created by mankind to safeguard the collection of an extraterrestrial resource crucial to human survival, known as Starfall. Driven by ruthless factions, these fearsome mechanical giants have now become the key to dominate the scarce resource across the ruins of a green but abandoned Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/f265791ec888eeafa9e7ce78afc48ca9.poster.avif?t=1750328296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/f265791ec888eeafa9e7ce78afc48ca9.webm?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/f265791ec888eeafa9e7ce78afc48ca9.mp4?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover multiple Hunter playstyles and their destructive weapons, gear, mods, and abilities. Unleash raw power and obliterate your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/51f04d5708b07be26294b90061999894.poster.avif?t=1750328296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/51f04d5708b07be26294b90061999894.webm?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/51f04d5708b07be26294b90061999894.mp4?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elevate your teamwork in the hunting grounds. Mastering your Hunters' unique abilities will keep you alive, but it's only by displaying perfect team synergy that you'll secure a victorious extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/471a7c5da2583d31d02756dd9715b31f.poster.avif?t=1750328296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/471a7c5da2583d31d02756dd9715b31f.webm?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/471a7c5da2583d31d02756dd9715b31f.mp4?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick reflexes alone won't cut it. Instead, sound tactics will carve your path to extract with Starfall. Will you charge headfirst through other teams or exploit the terrain to outmaneuver them? Every hunt matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/4f6f67a9cf53304760cce5d2c14622db.poster.avif?t=1750328296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/4f6f67a9cf53304760cce5d2c14622db.webm?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/4f6f67a9cf53304760cce5d2c14622db.mp4?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Hunter favors a distinct playstyle and has a unique progression system, making them a true menace in battle. Collect boosters and gear to gain an advantage in combat against your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/6e02c49ec1c2be2450cea1ca48796537.poster.avif?t=1750328296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/6e02c49ec1c2be2450cea1ca48796537.webm?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/6e02c49ec1c2be2450cea1ca48796537.mp4?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of an unstoppable machine. Smash through buildings to ambush your rivals or use structures as cover until they collapse under enemy fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/400ce18a43fb9b1dfae7f2df4e47695f.poster.avif?t=1750328296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/400ce18a43fb9b1dfae7f2df4e47695f.webm?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/400ce18a43fb9b1dfae7f2df4e47695f.mp4?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse the land to pursue dynamic objectives with multiple PvE encounters. Just keep in mind that when you're not hunting, you're being hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/d87709a6b5313e60e5df5854b790c82e.avif?t=1750328296\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a cataclysmic event, Hunters were created by mankind to safeguard the collection of an extraterrestrial resource crucial to human survival, known as Starfall. Driven by ruthless factions, these fearsome mechanical giants have now become the key to dominate the scarce resource across the ruins of a green but abandoned Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/f265791ec888eeafa9e7ce78afc48ca9.poster.avif?t=1750328296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/f265791ec888eeafa9e7ce78afc48ca9.webm?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/f265791ec888eeafa9e7ce78afc48ca9.mp4?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover multiple Hunter playstyles and their destructive weapons, gear, mods, and abilities. Unleash raw power and obliterate your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/51f04d5708b07be26294b90061999894.poster.avif?t=1750328296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/51f04d5708b07be26294b90061999894.webm?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/51f04d5708b07be26294b90061999894.mp4?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elevate your teamwork in the hunting grounds. Mastering your Hunters' unique abilities will keep you alive, but it's only by displaying perfect team synergy that you'll secure a victorious extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/471a7c5da2583d31d02756dd9715b31f.poster.avif?t=1750328296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/471a7c5da2583d31d02756dd9715b31f.webm?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/471a7c5da2583d31d02756dd9715b31f.mp4?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick reflexes alone won't cut it. Instead, sound tactics will carve your path to extract with Starfall. Will you charge headfirst through other teams or exploit the terrain to outmaneuver them? Every hunt matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/4f6f67a9cf53304760cce5d2c14622db.poster.avif?t=1750328296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/4f6f67a9cf53304760cce5d2c14622db.webm?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/4f6f67a9cf53304760cce5d2c14622db.mp4?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Hunter favors a distinct playstyle and has a unique progression system, making them a true menace in battle. Collect boosters and gear to gain an advantage in combat against your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/6e02c49ec1c2be2450cea1ca48796537.poster.avif?t=1750328296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/6e02c49ec1c2be2450cea1ca48796537.webm?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/6e02c49ec1c2be2450cea1ca48796537.mp4?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of an unstoppable machine. Smash through buildings to ambush your rivals or use structures as cover until they collapse under enemy fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/400ce18a43fb9b1dfae7f2df4e47695f.poster.avif?t=1750328296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/400ce18a43fb9b1dfae7f2df4e47695f.webm?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691340/extras/400ce18a43fb9b1dfae7f2df4e47695f.mp4?t=1750328296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse the land to pursue dynamic objectives with multiple PvE encounters. Just keep in mind that when you're not hunting, you're being hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "STEEL HUNTERS is a Free-to-Play, PvPvE shooter with futuristic mech battles. Level up your Hunter and upgrade your arsenal to turn rivals into scrap. Choose your playstyle and combat tactics against 5 other duo teams. Only one can extract from the Hunting Grounds.",
